{"id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-j-dense-monomorphism.md","title":"Definition — j-稠密单射","display":"Definition — j-稠密单射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","aliases":["14-df-j-dense-monomorphism"],"display":"Definition — j-稠密单射","depends_on":["[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — j-稠密单射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a> 的 LT 拓扑；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\([m]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span>，闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_j([m])=[1_X].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJDense}(m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cl}_j([m])=[1_X].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.1–2。定义域明确限制为单射；全子对象用恒等单射的类表示，不依赖未绑定的裸 top_X。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobjects","statu